{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超表示，西藏那曲市巴青縣昨日晚上發生7.0級地震，對事件深感難過，他向遇難同胞表示深切哀悼，並對傷者及遇難者家屬致以慰問。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n李家超在社交專頁說，特區政府會留意災情發展，隨時準備透過賑災基金提供適切援助。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n他又祝願救援工作平安順利，受災的同胞早日渡過難關。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:03.872565+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:58:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:35.191981+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:28.125312+00:00","content_hash":"0612e533643a1044a333e97581a4146d90687438518776f9109ba81c60bb10bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}